    <string name="direct_private_guide">1. Pair your phone using the Aegis QR code while both devices share Wi-Fi.\n\n2. Install Tailscale on your PC and phone and sign in to the same account.\n\n3. Enable it on both devices and copy the PC address from Tailscale here. No router ports are needed.\n\n4. Test with Wi-Fi turned off on your phone.</string>
    <string name="direct_public_guide">1. Pair your phone using the QR code first.\n\n2. Reserve a local IP for your PC in the router. Under Port forwarding, forward TCP 48291 and TCP 48222 to that IP using the same numbers. If you change the external ports, enter them below.\n\n3. Enter the public router IP or a name that stays up to date. Test with mobile data.\n\nIf your provider shares your IP across homes, forwarding ports is insufficient: request a public IP or use Easy connection. If the connection works but the screen stays blank, use Easy connection; some routers block direct video.</string>
